{
  "description": "Board surfaces for on-screen boards. kind 'board' is an image of a whole 8x8 board with a light square at the top left (Lichess); 'pair' is a light and a dark square texture in two files (PyChess); 'stacked' is one image with the light texture in its top half and the dark one below (ChessX). Any square texture may also be tinted with flat colours (boardgen/textures.py).",
